WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,520
Aren't you two crazy?

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,320
Give me another look

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,080
Holy Son, he asked for help from the Holy Land.

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,280
If you dare to kill me

5
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,960
Qiongxiao Holy Land will not let you go

6
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,160
You will also be buried with me

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,200
Have your sweet dream

8
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,280
One person to accompany you on the road is not enough

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,200
I want two more

10
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,980
Is that what he meant?

11
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,100
Don't worry, I have good moral character and won't kill you.

12
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,340
But was beaten to a disability

13
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,300
You two can't run away

14
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,420
Beaten to a disability

15
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,340
Is this more painful than killing them?

16
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,060
One is the prince of the Mansion Dynasty

17
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,300
The other one is the saint from Qiongxiao Holy Land.

18
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,540
Don’t you like hugging his thigh?

19
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,180
Everyone is angry and wants others

20
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,460
Otherwise the building would not have started

21
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:37,410
We will all be destroyed by him

22
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:39,010
you can't touch me

23
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,530
Otherwise, the building dynasty will be fine with you

24
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:42,370
Always fight to the death

25
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:44,690
That's our boss's business.

26
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:48,010
If the sky falls, he will hold it up

27
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:50,050
The fight is over

28
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:56,930
Why do you have to resort to such harsh measures and not return the favor?
